  "description": "<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\">&bull; Brand introduction: <span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: proxima-nova, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline;\">At Herriet, we believe that luxury and comfort should go hand-in-hand, even in the comfort of your own home. Dedicated to women who love to look and feel their best, our lifestyle brand offers a curated selection of high-quality essentials designed for everyday elegance. From our signature silk pillowcases and pyjamas to Tencel Modal sleepwear, silk scrunchies, and night masks, we provide thoughtful pieces that elevate your daily routines with a touch of indulgence.</span><br style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: proxima-nova, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center; white-space: normal;\"><br style=\"border-width: 0px; border-style: solid; box-sizing: border-box; color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: proxima-nova, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center; white-space: normal;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 51, 51); font-family: proxima-nova, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 300; text-align: center; white-space: normal; float: none; display: inline;\">Beyond our product range, we are committed to creating a haven of self-care and relaxation. Our scented candles set the perfect mood, while our silk accessories ensure beauty and comfort meet at every turn. At Herriet, we invite you to embrace luxury, effortlessly.</span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal;\"><br>&bull; Product description: Silk Pillowcases with multiple benefits for skin and hair.</p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: left; font-size